Package: opennebula-cognit-frontend
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenNebula COGNIT Frontend API server
 The COGNIT Frontend is a software component that acts as the single point
 of contact for any Application Device Runtime that requests access to the
 COGNIT Framework to offload computation through the FaaS paradigm.
 .
 This package includes a bundled Python virtual environment with all
 required dependencies.

